---
// The product dimension as a star (one flat table) and as a snowflake (a chain of normalised tables).
---
<figure class="svs">
  <div class="svs-grid">
    <div class="svs-panel">
      <h4>Star: one flat dimension</h4>
      <div class="svs-chain">
        <div class="svs-fact">fact_sales</div>
        <div class="svs-link" aria-hidden="true">↓ product_key</div>
        <div class="svs-dim">dim_product<span>product_name, brand, category_name, department</span></div>
      </div>
      <p>1 join to reach department. "Tech" is stored on 6 rows.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svs-panel">
      <h4>Snowflake: a chain of tables</h4>
      <div class="svs-chain">
        <div class="svs-fact">fact_sales</div>
        <div class="svs-link" aria-hidden="true">↓ product_key</div>
        <div class="svs-dim">dim_product_sf<span>product_name, brand</span></div>
        <div class="svs-link" aria-hidden="true">↓ category_key</div>
        <div class="svs-dim">dim_category<span>category_name</span></div>
        <div class="svs-link" aria-hidden="true">↓ department_key</div>
        <div class="svs-dim">dim_department<span>department_name</span></div>
      </div>
      <p>3 joins to reach department. "Tech" is stored once.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Same facts, same answers. The star repeats a little text to save joins; the snowflake removes the repeats but makes every query and every report model longer.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style is:inline>
.svs { margin: 20px 0; }
.svs-grid { display: grid; gap: 12px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
.svs-panel { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 12px; background: var(--surface); }
.svs h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 15px; }
.svs-chain { display: grid; gap: 2px; justify-items: center; text-align: center; }
.svs-fact, .svs-dim { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13.5px; }
.svs-fact { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
.svs-dim { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--accent-soft); }
.svs-dim span { display: block; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
.svs-link { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.svs-panel p { margin: 8px 0 2px; font-size: 13.5px; }
.svs figcaption { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
